{"articleNo":"2330","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2330&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009학년도 2학기 성적취소 및 이수구분 변경신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.09.23","hit":"19816","attachments":[{"name":"폐지과목내역~.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2330&attachNo=1472"},{"name":"2009학년도2학기성적취소신청원.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2330&attachNo=1474"},{"name":"2009학년도2학기이수구분변경원.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2330&attachNo=1517"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">성적취소 및 이수구분 변경신청 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 50%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 50%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">2009학년도 2학기 성적취소 및 이수구분 변경에 관한 사항을 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">아래와</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"> 같이 안내하오니 희망하는 학생은 신청하시기 바랍니</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">◀ 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래 ▶</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">1. 성적취소 대상</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> (재학생에 한함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;가. 동일과목이 중복 취득되어 있는 성적(제한 없음)&nbsp; </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;나. 현행 교육과정상 폐지된 교과목의 성적(제한 없음) </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;다. 기 이수한 교과목 중 본인이 원하는 교과목 성적(6학점 이내)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2. 이수구분 변경 대상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 47.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -47.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;<font size=\"2\"> </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">가. 복수전공, 부전공, 교직과정 이수 신청 또는 취소로 인하여 이수 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 47.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -47.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;구분이 맞지 않은 경우 변경 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;예) - 일반선택과목&nbsp; ○○과목을 복수전공 필수로</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 교직과정 ○○과목을&nbsp; 일반선택과목으로 변경</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 동일 학부내 타전공 일반선택 ○○과목을 전공선택으로 변경</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;<font size=\"2\">&nbsp;다. </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"><font size=\"2\">2005학년도 이전 입학자로서 복학 시</font> <font size=\"2\">공학교육</font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font size=\"2\">인증과정</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"><font size=\"2\">으로 선택한 학생 중</font>&nbsp;<br><font size=\"2\">이수구분이</font></span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><font size=\"2\"> 맞지 않은 경우</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">3. 신청 기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2009. 9. 28(월) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">～</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> 2009. 9. 30(수)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">4. 신청 장소</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">각 학부(과) 종합학사행정실</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font size=\"2\">☞</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><font size=\"2\"> 테크노관(☎478-7359),디지털관(☎478-7751),글로벌관(☎478-7598)에 위치</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">5. 제출서류</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font size=\"2\"> </font></span><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"><font size=\"2\">가. 성적취소 신청원 및 이수구분</font> <font size=\"2\">변경원 각 1부(</font></span></font><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"><font size=\"2\">해당</font> <font size=\"2\">종합학사행정실 비치</font></span></font><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.5pt\">)</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"><font size=\"2\">나. 성적증명서 1부(2009. 9. 28일 이후 발행분):</font> <font size=\"2\">해당 과목에 </font></span><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"><font size=\"2\">형광펜</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"> <font size=\"2\">표시</font></span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">6. 기타사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 19.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -19.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">▘</span><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><font size=\"2\">성적취소를 신청한 교과목의 성적은</font> <font size=\"2\">학적변동(휴학, 제적)에 관계없이 삭</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"><font size=\"2\">제처리<br>&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><font size=\"2\">되며,</font>&nbsp;<font size=\"2\">삭제된 교과목의 성적은 재 인정될 수 없으므로 신중하게</font></span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><font size=\"2\"> 신청하시기 바랍니다.</font> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 19.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -19.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▘</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">신청원에 빠짐없이 작성하여 제출하여 함(예: 교과목코드)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 19.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -19.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;<font size=\"2\">※</font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font size=\"2\"> 교과목코드조회: 원스톱서비스- 교과과정조회 , 개인별 원스톱서비스 - 학적 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 19.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -19.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font size=\"2\">&nbsp;- </font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">학적 및 각종자료조회 - 성적(본인이 이수한 교과목코드 조회 가능 )</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 19.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -19.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"><font size=\"2\">▘</font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"><font size=\"2\">성적취소 및 이수구분 변경된 성적은 2009.</font> <font size=\"2\">10. 23일 이후에 확인 가능</font></span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 19.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -19.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp; <font size=\"2\">(성적취소확인 : 원스톱로그인-학적-학적및각종자료조회-“성적정정”)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 19.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -19.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font size=\"2\">(이수구분확인 : 원스톱로그인-학적-학적및각종자료조회-“이수구분”)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 19.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -19.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font size=\"2\">▘필수 과목은 폐지된 과목(교과목코드, 과목명이 모두 동일해야만</font> <font size=\"2\">해당 과목임)이라도 동일대체과목으로 지정되어 있다면 이수해야 됨.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2009. 9.&nbsp; .</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">교&nbsp; 무&nbsp; 연&nbsp; 구&nbsp; 과&nbsp; 장&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
